{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A racing adventure with quirky physics and asynchronous multiplayer (ghosts). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654200/extras/Ghosts.png?t=1746382693\" />&gt; Find all the secret passages and break the levels while you are at it.<br>&gt; Join thousands of other players and compete in the daily &amp; weekly event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I you are looking for graphics fidelity then please move on. This one is all about skill. It looks easy at the start, but it's not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HINT: Go watch the top players to learn how to beat the levels by using all sorts of shortcuts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy :-)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654200?t=1746382693","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654200/e09b0f05225e554208f5108fb675cc3e73a54bbb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746382693","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654200/2674d99b154271c45c236038bb121ad0cba2c05a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746382693","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654200/2674d99b154271c45c236038bb121ad0cba2c05a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746382693","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A racing adventure with quirky physics and asynchronous multiplayer (ghosts). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654200/extras/Ghosts.png?t=1746382693\" />&gt; Find all the secret passages and break the levels while you are at it.<br>&gt; Join thousands of other players and compete in the daily &amp; weekly event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I you are looking for graphics fidelity then please move on. This one is all about skill. It looks easy at the start, but it's not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HINT: Go watch the top players to learn how to beat the levels by using all sorts of shortcuts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy :-)</p>","developers":["KAMGAM e.U."],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654200/6eb221450d290071d72027a764be214a55fa333a/header.jpg?t=1746382693","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123953,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123953/movie480.mp4?t=1746382691","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123953/movie_max.mp4?t=1746382691"},"name":"Sunser Racer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123953/eb3c02115be3732f3dc78d0495c66707f1199cbc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746382691","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123953/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746382691","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123953/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746382691"}}],"name":"Sunset Racer","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core (Intel or AMD)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 330 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10+<br></li><li><stro